msgid "Built-in Icon Selector"
msgstr "内蔵アイコン選択"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:13
#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:39
msgid "Custom Icon Selector"
msgstr "カスタムアイコン選択"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:14
#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:63
msgid "Emoji Selector"
msgstr "絵文字の選択"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:15
#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:71
msgid "Preset Layout Selector"
msgstr "プリセットレイアウトの選択"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:16
msgid "Show Icon (mutually exclusive with Show Emoji)"
msgstr "アイコンを表示（「絵文字を表示」と排他）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:17
msgid "Show Emoji (mutually exclusive with Show Icon)"
msgstr "絵文字を表示（「アイコンを表示」と排他）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:18
msgid "Show Title"
msgstr "タイトルを表示"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:19
msgid "Show Shadow"
msgstr "影を表示"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:20
msgid ""
"Icon Parameter Settings - Adjust icon size, rotation, and XY-axis position "
"using sliders"
msgstr "アイコン設定（サイズ・回転・XY 位置をスライダーで調整）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:21
msgid "Title Edit Box - Supports multi-line text"
msgstr "タイトル編集欄（複数行入力に対応）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:22
msgid "Title Font Settings - Adjust title font, bold, and italic styles"
msgstr "タイトルのフォント設定（書体・太字・斜体など）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:23
msgid ""
"Title Parameter Settings - Adjust title size, rotation, and XY-axis position"
" using sliders"
msgstr "タイトル設定（サイズ・回転・XY 位置をスライダーで調整）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:27
msgid ""
"Click ② in the foreground editing interface to open the built-in icon "
"selector."
msgstr "前景の編集画面で ② をクリックし、内蔵アイコン選択を開きます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:29
msgid ""
"The built-in icon selector contains over 7,000 icons organized by category."
msgstr "内蔵アイコンは 7,000 種類以上あり、カテゴリ別に閲覧できます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:31
msgid "![1742258436213](image/foreground/1742258436213.png)"
msgstr "![1742258436213](image/foreground/1742258436213.png)"

