msgstr "1742258436213"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:35
msgid "Icon Search - Search by icon code or keywords"
msgstr "アイコン検索（コード名やキーワード）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:36
msgid "Icon History - Recently selected icons appear here"
msgstr "アイコン履歴（最近使ったアイコン）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:37
msgid ""
"Icon Category Browser - Click to open icon categories, scroll down to view "
"more categories"
msgstr "カテゴリ一覧（クリックで開き、下にスクロールして追加カテゴリを表示）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:41
msgid ""
"Click ③ in the foreground editing interface to open the custom icon "
"selector."
msgstr "前景の編集画面で ③ をクリックし、カスタムアイコン選択を開きます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:43
msgid "![1742259897464](image/foreground/1742259897464.png)"
msgstr "![1742259897464](image/foreground/1742259897464.png)"

