msgstr "フォント検索（名前で絞り込み）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:86
msgid "Recently Used Fonts - Your recently selected fonts appear here"
msgstr "最近使ったフォント"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/foreground.md:87
msgid ""
"Font List - Preview font appearances directly, with multiple font styles "
"shown in submenus if available"
msgstr "フォント一覧（見た目をプレビュー。スタイルが複数ある場合はサブメニューに表示）"
